'''Slurpuff''' (Japanese: '''ペロリーム''' ''Peroream'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

